  "summary": "Bind CC-002 and integration to the corrected CC-D12 completion.",
  "why": "The CC-002 card now binds OVR-000064, states the exact source-build authority, preserves candidate state NONE and the historical integrated_head, and records the four existing checkpoints plus the later actual-base obligation. Integration anchors the reviewed prefix at OVR-000065 so both replacement workstream states are authoritative without creating a self-hash cycle. The earlier OVR-000062 revision already binds the direct RDF dependency, GraphRecipe rebind, hard tests, and evidence before their verification."
